{"overview":{"Symbol":"AVEX","Name":"AEVEX Corp.","Description":"AEVEX Corp. operates as a defense technology contractor and enabler of the U.S. Unmanned Aerial Systems (UAS) dominance strategy mission. The company operates in two segments, Tactical Systems and Global Solutions. The Tactical Systems designs and manufactures battle-tested, autonomous, modular, and attritable unmanned systems, including UAS and unmanned surface vehicles with other mission critical products. The Global Solutions provides bespoke mission solutions, including AI-enabled airborne intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance (ISR), C-UAS, additive manufacturing, and specialized mission aircraft engineering, modification, and testing. The company was founded in 2020 and is based in Solana Beach, California.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NYSE","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Industrials","Industry":"Aerospace & Defense","Address":"440 Stevens Avenue, Solana Beach, CA, 92075, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"1176276992","EBITDA":"80856000","PERatio":"53.41026","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"4.288","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"0.39","RevenuePerShareTTM":"6.737","ProfitMargin":"0.052600004","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.1367","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"","RevenueTTM":"596368000","GrossProfitTTM":"147735008","DilutedEPSTTM":"0.39","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"3.069","AnalystTargetPrice":"36","TrailingPE":"53.41026","ForwardPE":"42.657326","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"1.9724013","PriceToBookRatio":"4.8577423","EVToRevenue":"2.339","EVToEBITDA":"17.251","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"42.34","52WeekLow":"19.72","50DayMovingAverage":"28.43421","200DayMovingAverage":"28.43421","SharesOutstanding":"56470333","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"77.757"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"AVEX","3. Last 